 in Tajima's house and offers to take care of his daily needs.\n\nUnable to figure out her true intentions, Tajima nevertheless accepts her offer, his curiosity as a novelist outweighing his reservations. Shino acts as though she knows exactly who he is, confidently declaring, *\"I want to be of use to you, Sensei.\"*\n\nWhat lies hidden in the depths of those jet-black eyes of hers...?","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Thriller","Psychological","Romance","Drama","Mystery"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/67e79cef-5367-4977-bbbe-e47925cbc855/13a34493-06c0-4fc0-8f27-8cd8f9e44fa0.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["vi","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.02,"follows":2152,"listAt":"2026-10-25T07:01:11.113Z","chapters":[{"id":"8f96f04a-0f57-43a7-8f86-495f324b9bdf","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2026-10-22T18:29:35+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-22T19:01:40.501Z"},"d05bfa47-631c-4ebb-b590-11159206009b":{"id":"d05bfa47-631c-4ebb-b590-11159206009b","title":"Juumonji-kun shika Mienai!!","altTitle":"Juumonji in Sight!","description":"Asahi Nishizono has finally made her high school debut. But ever since she was a little girl, she's never been able to forget her first love, You Kazami. Even now, she can't take her eyes off his handsome face...\n\n...or so she thought, until a huge shadow suddenly blocks her view.\n\n“WHOA! JUUMONJI?!”\n\nThat's Touya Juumonji, Kazami's childhood friend who's always by his side. Not only is he huge, he's also ridiculously talented at all sorts of things. And somehow, Juumonji always manages to steal Nishizono's view of Kazami...?!","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d05bfa47-631c-4ebb-b590-11159206009b/f32b895d-da3a-43a2-88d5-bf31c353ae0a.png.512.jp